{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Sabbaths of years.</b> Sabbatical years. One might think he could make seven consecutive years sabbatical and then make Jubilee after them — therefore Scripture says: ״seven years seven times״ — you must conclude each sabbatical year in its proper time (Sifra)." "<b>And they shall be for you days of seven, etc.</b> This tells you that even if you did not observe the sabbatical years, you must make Jubilee at the end of 49 years. And the plain sense of the verse: you shall reckon for yourself the count of the sabbatical years — to the number 49."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:13.409463670Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}